timer2dagu report: job.timer + job.service

untranslated (1):
  job.timer:5 OnBootSec=: relative to boot; Dagu has no boot-time trigger

approximated (1):
  job.timer:6 OnUnitActiveSec=: '1d' became '@every 24h': systemd counts from the service's last activation, Dagu from its scheduler's own clock
